{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"50245eed5733c68f","name":"card_unit_the_professionals","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/USA/Homefront/units/card_unit_the_professionals","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"THE PROFESSIONALS","text":"Destruction: All units in your deck get +2+3 and a random combat keyword.","flavorText":"Nicknamed \"The Professionals,\" the 46th Infantry Regiment earned its reputation during WWII as the tip of the spear for the US 5th Armored Division. After reactivation in 1941 at Fort Knox, the unit trained intensively before landing in Normandy in 1944. It soon led the breakout through France, pushing rapidly across enemy lines during the Allied advance. The 46th was often the first element of the 5th Armored to make contact with German forces, securing key towns and road junctions. In one notable advance, they captured the strategic town of Domfront in Normandy in August 1944, forcing a hasty German retreat. The regiment continued its push through Luxembourg and into Germany, participating in five major campaigns. Their consistent frontline role and effectiveness in rapid, mechanized warfare earned them their other nickname: \"Victory’s Spearpoint\".","faction":"USA","type":"infantry","rarity":"Unique","cost":7,"operationCost":2,"attack":7,"defense":8},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"GameplayTags":["ability.bond"],"Name":"card_unit_the_professionals","title":{"Namespace":"card_usa","Key":"card_unit_the_professionals_title","SourceString":"THE PROFESSIONALS","LocalizedString":"THE PROFESSIONALS"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::infantry","attack":7,"defense":8,"range":1,"faction":"EFactionEnum::USA","kredits":7,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_usa","Key":"card_unit_the_professionals_text","SourceString":"Destruction: All units in your deck get +2+3 and a random combat keyword.","LocalizedString":"Destruction: All units in your deck get +2+3 and a random combat keyword."},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_usa","Key":"card_unit_the_profess